      ],
      "schema:abstract": "Readers should be able to step through token-by-token generation, distinguish model computation from selection, explain prefill/decode, and connect latency metrics to serving mechanisms without confusing scheduling with prediction.",
      "schema:description": "Describes autoregressive inference and its main serving mechanisms: prefill/decode, KV caching, latency, multi-request scheduling, continuous batching, prefix caching, and chunked prefill. Transformer internals and parameter learning remain outside its scope.",
