      "schema:abstract": "Readers should be able to name each configuration dimension, map each field to the tensor shapes it determines, and explain why validation fails early with a named message instead of late with a shape error.",
      "schema:description": "Explains the gpt_config.py file line by line: the role of the GPTConfig object, the purpose of each dimension, immutability and construction-time validation. Excludes the model computation, the Transformer block and the generation loop.",
