      "schema:description": "Develops the Platonic Representation Hypothesis through the Balestriero-LeCun conditional convergence theorem for JEPAs: positive-pair graphs, good and bad views, spectral embedding, nuisance variables, the next-token-prediction interpretation, and a qualified reading of cross-modal alignment experiments. Token-level contextualization remains on en/contextualized-representations; resource-performance regularities remain on en/scaling-laws.",
